notes               = "One poem across two printed pages — the dedication به نقاشانِ جوان: قربانی، صادق‌زاده، نوبهار ('To the young painters: Ghorbani, Sadeghzadeh, Nobahar') heads page 104, and both the date and the footnote to Sohrab Sepehri come only at the foot of 105. Recombined here, so page_number is a range and the source's asterisked footnote goes to ===footnotes===. ذکر is the Sufi term for repeated invocation, so «ذکر دوستت دارم» sets 'I love you' where the name of God would go; kept as 'invocation' rather than flattened to 'saying'. نگاهی تَر, a wet gaze, is the same figure footnoted in desert-moonlight. Imported as a draft with machine / lantern layers; ===translation=== left for Ben."
